        <mxCell id="vcGz2X3xdQekcJThql-k-4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;WARNING:&lt;br&gt;As a generality, projects spend a large amount of time discussing user experience and the design of business information system records -- without clearly&amp;nbsp;recognizing their ISO-25022 / ISO-25012 Qualities are only obtainable based on the correct management of related - earlier - information areas.&lt;br&gt;Specifically, unambiguous and automatically testable CLEAR &amp;amp; SMART &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px&quot;&gt;Design Instructions, mapped to ISO-25030 categories (which point to ISO-25010, ISO-25012, ISO-25022 among others) -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;in order to not reduce the risk of&amp;nbsp;later having to wonder why the project didn&#39;t spend more time &lt;i&gt;first&lt;/i&gt; Defining where it was going, for what Objectives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingTop=-6;rounded=1;strokeWidth=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" parent="vcGz2X3xdQekcJThql-k-30" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="750" width="560" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
