        <mxCell id="T1WR9YVkstTIkw9Bh6QR-3" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#000000&quot;&gt;Custom modules are most often parallel to each other, &lt;br&gt;sharing nothing but Core Module models and services,&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;but can also be stacked, reusing models and services&lt;br&gt;from one or more other custom modules..&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=-4;fontSize=14;fontColor=#B3B3B3;" parent="cRdDGdkHSjeA-h-rfshC-0" vertex="1">
