        <UserObject label="" tooltip="ABOUT&#xa;&#xa;Systems sometimes need to notify users of important events. For example, that the System will be taken down and will not be available for a while. &#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;These are commonly shown as Banners on user interfaces.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;These are not the same as Notifications targeted at User/Member.&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;Note: they can be very similar to Statements (in that once Viewed, they don&#39;t need to continue being shown." id="iG02E2HH8pFiy8MSK7G3-16">
